{% comment %}
@description: Trang tim kiem public cho bai viet, trang tinh va san pham.
@required_substrings: {% layout "layout" %}, {% block content %}, {% endblock %}, q, hasQuery, posts, pages, products, totalResults
@required_ids:
@notes: Nhan q, hasQuery, totalResults, posts[], pages[], products[] (pages[] co san url tinh san tu search.ts, khong tu ghep "/" + slug). Nen dung components/post/card.liquid va components/product/card.liquid de hien ket qua, khong copy lai HTML card dai trong file search. QUAN TRONG: {% render %} cua LiquidJS CO LAP HOAN TOAN scope (da kiem chung thuc te) - KHONG tu thay bien global nhu postUrlPrefix/productUrlPrefix, PHAI truyen tay tung lan goi render (vd {% render 'components/product/card', product: product, productUrlPrefix: productUrlPrefix, variant: 'list' %}), thieu se lam link san pham/bai viet trong ket qua tim kiem bi gay (loi that da gap).
{% endcomment %}

